<main class="shipping-page">

    <section class="shipping-hero">
        <h1>Shipping Information</h1>
        <p>
            Learn how we carefully prepare, package, and deliver your handmade
            creations with the utmost care.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="shipping-notice">

        <div class="notice-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation"></i>
        </div>

        <div class="notice-content">
            <h3>IMPORTANT NOTICE</h3>

            <p>
                Since every piece is made by hand, orders are only shipped once
                they are finished. Your shipping fee is calculated at that point
                and added to your remaining balance, so nothing is charged for
                delivery until we know exactly what your parcel weighs and where
                it is going.
            </p>
        </div>

    </section>


    <section class="shipping-journey">

        <h2>The Journey of Your Piece</h2>

        <div class="journey-timeline">

            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="journey-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i>
                </div>

                <div class="journey-line"></div>

                <h3>ORDER PLACED</h3>
                <p>Waiting for confirmation</p>

            </div>


            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="journey-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i>
                </div>

                <div class="journey-line"></div>

                <h3>IN PRODUCTION</h3>
                <p>Shaped and painted by hand</p>

            </div>


            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="journey-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i>
                </div>

                <div class="journey-line"></div>

                <h3>SHIPPED</h3>
                <p>In transit to you</p>

            </div>


            <div class="journey-step">

                <div class="journey-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i>
                </div>

                <h3>DELIVERED</h3>
                <p>Arrived safely</p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <section class="shipping-details">

        <article class="shipping-detail">

            <div class="detail-icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-start"></i>
            </div>

            <h2>Processing Time</h2>

            <p>
                Every piece is sculpted, baked and painted individually, so
                production starts once your down payment is confirmed and takes
                as long as the design needs. Simple pieces are quicker; detailed
                or personalised ones take longer. We will always let you know
                what to expect for your order.
            </p>

        </article>


        <article class="shipping-detail">

            <div class="detail-icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-crosshairs"></i>
            </div>

            <h2>Order Tracking</h2>

            <p>
                Once your parcel is handed to the courier, the tracking number
                appears on your order page under My Orders, and we will message
                it to you on Instagram or Facebook. You can use it to follow your
                parcel's journey to your door.
            </p>

        </article>

    </section>


    <section class="shipping-methods">

        <h2>Shipping Fees</h2>

        <div class="methods-divider"></div>

        <div class="method-grid">

            <article class="shipping-method-card">

                <h3>Calculated Per Order</h3>

                <p>
                    We do not charge a flat rate. Your shipping fee depends on
                    the weight of your finished pieces and your delivery address,
                    so you only pay what it actually costs to send.
                </p>

                <div class="method-divider"></div>

                <div class="method-info">

                    <div>
                        <span>WHEN</span>
                        <strong>After production</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="method-fee">
                        <span>PAID WITH</span>
                        <strong>Your balance</strong>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="shipping-method-card">

                <h3>How You Are Told</h3>

                <p>
                    Once your pieces are finished we work out the shipping fee
                    and request your remaining balance. The amount is shown on
                    your order page before you pay anything.
                </p>

                <div class="method-divider"></div>

                <div class="method-info">

                    <div>
                        <span>WHERE</span>
                        <strong>My Orders</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="method-fee">
                        <span>PAY VIA</span>
                        <strong>GCash</strong>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>

        </div>

    </section>


    <section class="shipping-bottom-grid">

        <article class="shipping-bottom-card">

            <div class="bottom-icon">
                <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i>
            </div>

            <h2>Delays &amp; Issues</h2>

            <p>
                While we strive for punctuality, external factors such as severe
                weather or carrier disruptions may occasionally cause delays.
                We appreciate your patience as we make sure your delicate pieces
                arrive safely.
            </p>

        </article>


        <article class="shipping-bottom-card">

            <div class="bottom-icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-box"></i>
            </div>

            <h2>Damaged Packages</h2>

            <p>
                Handmade clay pieces are delicate. If your order arrives damaged,
                please keep all the packaging and message us on Instagram or
                Facebook with photos as soon as you can, and we will sort it out
                with you.
            </p>

        </article>

    </section>

</main>